{"html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"pt-BR\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Caderno de viagem</title>\n<style>\n:root { color-scheme: light; }\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\nbody { margin: 0; background: #fbfaf8; color: #1d1b19; font: 17px/1.65 Georgia, \"Noto Serif\", \"Times New Roman\", serif; }\nmain { max-width: 40rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 4rem 1.5rem 6rem; }\nh1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 { line-height: 1.25; margin: 2.2em 0 .6em; font-weight: 600; }\nh1 { font-size: 2em; margin-top: 0; }\nh2 { font-size: 1.5em; }\nh3 { font-size: 1.2em; }\nh4, h5, h6 { font-size: 1em; }\np, ul, ol, blockquote, pre, table { margin: 0 0 1.2em; }\na { color: #8a3d1c; text-underline-offset: .15em; }\nimg { max-width: 100%; height: auto; }\nhr { border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #cfc8bf; margin: 2.5em 0; }\nblockquote { margin-left: 0; padding-left: 1.1em; border-left: 3px solid #cfc8bf; color: #55504a; }\ncode, pre { font-family: \"JetBrains Mono\", \"DejaVu Sans Mono\", Consolas, monospace; font-size: .86em; }\ncode { background: #efebe5; padding: .1em .3em; border-radius: 3px; }\npre { background: #efebe5; padding: 1em 1.2em; overflow-x: auto; border-radius: 4px; line-height: 1.5; }\npre code { background: none; padding: 0; font-size: 1em; }\nul, ol { padding-left: 1.6em; }\nli { margin: .25em 0; }\nli.tarefa { list-style: none; margin-left: -1.4em; }\nli.feita { color: #77716a; }\ntable { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-size: .95em; }\nth, td { border-bottom: 1px solid #cfc8bf; padding: .45em .7em; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }\nth { border-bottom-width: 2px; }\n@media print {\n  body { background: none; font-size: 11.5pt; }\n  main { max-width: none; padding: 0; }\n  a { color: inherit; }\n  pre, blockquote, table, img { break-inside: avoid; }\n  h1, h2, h3, h4 { break-after: avoid; }\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>Caderno de viagem</h1>\n<p>Três dias na serra, <strong>sem pressa</strong>. O plano cabe numa lista:</p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"tarefa feita\">☑ comprar o mapa</li>\n<li class=\"tarefa\">☐ conferir a previsão do tempo</li>\n<li class=\"tarefa\">☐ separar a <em>lanterna</em></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Primeiro dia</h2>\n<p>A trilha começa atrás da pousada e sobe por uns quarenta minutos até o\nmirante. De lá se vê o vale inteiro.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Levar água. Sempre mais do que parece necessário.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>O que levar</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Água</li>\n<li>Um casaco</li>\n<li><code>mapa.pdf</code> no telefone</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>Segundo dia</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr><th align=\"left\">Trecho</th><th align=\"right\">Distância</th><th align=\"right\">Tempo</th></tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td align=\"left\">Mirante</td><td align=\"right\">4 km</td><td align=\"right\">1 h</td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"left\">Cachoeira</td><td align=\"right\">7 km</td><td align=\"right\">2 h</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Mais em <a href=\"https://exemplo.org/guia\">o guia da serra</a>.</p>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}
